{"id":"2c35c034ffcc7839a4ec73383a7fb26b8602d5cf","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237107","title":"有没有感觉自从用 ai coding 后几乎不会进入心流状态了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"tangler","excerpt":"程序员 - @tangler - 用 ai 后并行开发越来越多,纯 vibe 几乎不需要了解细节,也不做太多设计,但一直在动脑子,还很烦躁.脑雾感很重,一片混乱自己写代码好歹会进入心流,也没那么累偶尔还挺爽","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>用 ai 后并行开发越来越多,纯 vibe 几乎不需要了解细节,也不做太多设计,但一直在动脑子,还很烦躁.脑雾感很重,一片混乱</p>\n<p>自己写代码好歹会进入心流,也没那么累偶尔还挺爽</p>\n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/心流\"><li></li> 心流</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/开发\"><li></li> 开发</a></P><p><span>28 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-26 12:08:48 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016380\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1cc0d57a98440c0e9873a878db41f0c7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"rhl88\" data-uid=\"422219\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rhl88\">rhl88</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 16:43:50 +08:00\">22h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没有感觉自己像马夫？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016421\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8596/7ccc/171183_normal.png?m=1761547428\" alt=\"tangler\" data-uid=\"171183\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tangler\">tangler</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 16:52:04 +08:00\">22h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/rhl88\">rhl88</a> 更像是传动轴,路是轮子跑出来的,要去哪是马夫控制的.我要解析马夫的想法然后告诉轮子怎么转,转多少速度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016702\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/be86/c551/472822_normal.png?m=1782709843\" alt=\"sillydaddy\" data-uid=\"472822\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sillydaddy\">sillydaddy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:33:27 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是啊，和 AI 异步协作开发，一卡一顿的感觉真不好受。所以我怀疑那些当老板的，是不是从来不会进入心流，每天都要开会、处理繁杂的事务。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016840\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2881/bc1c/631034_normal.png?m=1785482610\" alt=\"whywhathow\" data-uid=\"631034\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whywhathow\">whywhathow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 17:56:22 +08:00\">21h 31m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>最大恐惧是,忙里忙外,自己一无所获的无力感/🕳</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017019\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2881/bc1c/631034_normal.png?m=1785482610\" alt=\"whywhathow\" data-uid=\"631034\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whywhathow\">whywhathow</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 18:40:43 +08:00\">20h 47m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lxxzml\">lxxzml</a> 我的感受更像是自己的 context 被撑爆, 跟不上 ai 的思路噻. emmm, 要用/grill-me 了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017057\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 18:56:10 +08:00\">20h 31m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>产品经理会进入心流吗？我感觉做家务都能进入心流😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017097\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3d3/8d4b/308276_normal.png?m=1664944247\" alt=\"jaoyina\" data-uid=\"308276\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jaoyina\">jaoyina</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 19:10:28 +08:00\">20h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不用 AI 心流是什么感觉？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017106\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7aee/26c3/2719_normal.png?m=1783137169\" alt=\"loading\" data-uid=\"2719\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 19:12:37 +08:00\">20h 15m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>正常，你只是正在成为恶龙。<br>心态放松，以前产品经理不会细看你的代码，现在你也可以适当放开一点。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017179\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f16/c818/1085_normal.png?m=1760330213\" alt=\"iiduce\" data-uid=\"1085\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iiduce\">iiduce</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 19:40:50 +08:00\">19h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>是这样的，这是我开始 vibe coding 后最大的遗憾。</p><p>我之前写代码比较容易进入心流状态，vibe coding 后一次也没有过。</p><p>vibe coding 也有爽感，但显然和心流状态不同。心流状态的爽感来自于内啡肽，vibe coding 则来自于多巴胺，和赌博、性交手淫一样，vibe coding 完，经常是一阵空虚。完成了目标，却没有以前手写代码的满足感。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017184\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f06/6f8f/401678_normal.png?m=1770468392\" alt=\"levelworm\" data-uid=\"401678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levelworm\">levelworm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 19:42:48 +08:00\">19h 45m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那是。心流是需要用功的。所以我现在仅用 AI 做文档、流程图这些没人看的东西，顺便刷榜，写代码还是自己手写—-除了一些脚本扔给 AI 之外。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017206\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ed3ac2b587c20a4d7cb43e5fa6ef927e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tangzui\" data-uid=\"522901\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tangzui\">tangzui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 19:50:28 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最崩不住的是你去接口别人 vibe coding 的代码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017271\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 20:22:02 +08:00\">19h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个项目一个项目的搞，一个模块的搞。同时开多个项目，大脑就被撑爆了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017305\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c854/a6b5/123312_normal.png?m=1434923027\" alt=\"jh623\" data-uid=\"123312\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jh623\">jh623</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 20:37:48 +08:00\">18h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉还好啊，ai 在干活，自己规划下一步，或者考虑架构优化。我写下一步规划都写了几千字了，近百个需求，完成一个删一个，还挺爽。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017324\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/950278cf5f637f3f0ddc116601e93969?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nsjs\" data-uid=\"507787\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nsjs\">nsjs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 20:46:45 +08:00\">18h 41m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换个快点的 ai agent 也能进入心流的，类似 REPL ，发指令看结果的循环</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017353\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4062/6f1e/257375_normal.png?m=1554860639\" alt=\"lucays\" data-uid=\"257375\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lucays\">lucays</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 21:00:04 +08:00\">18h 28m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>心流有啥用，心流完了脑子特别累<br>其他人的代码我接手也直接 ai 一把梭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017355\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 21:00:52 +08:00\">18h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己全栈开发还好，还需要和前/后端对接的时候真是噩梦，AI 写的有些细节我是真不知道它怎么想的...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18017855\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/791c/31ff/539910_normal.png?m=1782200667\" alt=\"yoyoyoyolol\" data-uid=\"539910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yoyoyoyolol\">yoyoyoyolol</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 04:44:21 +08:00\">10h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实是这样，尤其是 token 用不完的情况下不想浪费，还要同时并行考虑其他产品的需求和产品设计，来回切换很麻烦，消耗大脑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18018204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ce9b/2824/627987_normal.png?m=1731316362\" alt=\"wukaige\" data-uid=\"627987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wukaige\">wukaige</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 09:22:37 +08:00\">6h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还是能进入心流状态的，把关键功能抽出来，和 ai 讨论功能设计，一步步优化最终定稿后，才让 ai 动手，而不是一上来就让 ai 完成某个功能。这样比较容易进入心流状态</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18018819\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fb34b1083c50fefe60f7ff2440a3185c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"noorall\" data-uid=\"669090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/noorall\">noorall</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 10:44:31 +08:00\">4h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>毕业前夕几乎每天都是心流，两周写了 3w 行数据库内核代码，怀念那段日子</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18018850\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8596/7ccc/171183_normal.png?m=1761547428\" alt=\"tangler\" data-uid=\"171183\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tangler\">tangler</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 10:48:19 +08:00\">4h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a> 我观察到的产品大部分时间也都在擦屁股,真正思考产品本身和写 prd 的时间不多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18019291\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/649d/755c/237796_normal.png?m=1786426996\" alt=\"xiaoyi123\" data-uid=\"237796\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiaoyi123\">xiaoyi123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 11:44:36 +08:00\">3h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>已经没有心流了，就是不停地切换不同的对话.</p><p>就像给多匹马喂食一样，看到哪匹马吃完了就赶紧投料...</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18019389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e879/7481/676308_normal.png?m=1764819213\" alt=\"youyouzi\" data-uid=\"676308\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/youyouzi\">youyouzi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-26 12:08:48 +08:00\">3h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>流水线生产哪有匠心可言？回归基本功，手搓代码，当编程仙人。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"用 ai 后并行开发越来越多,纯 vibe 几乎不需要了解细节,也不做太多设计,但一直在动脑子,还很烦躁.脑雾感很重,一片混乱 自己写代码好歹会进入心流,也没那么累偶尔还挺爽 心流 AI 开发28 replies • 2026-08-26 12:08:48 +08:00 1 rhl88 22h 44m ago 有没有感觉自己像马夫？ 2 tangler OP 22h 36m ago @rhl88 更像是传动轴,路是轮子跑出来的,要去哪是马夫控制的.我要解析马夫的想法然后告诉轮子怎么转,转多少速度 3 sillydaddy 21h 54m ago 是啊，和 AI 异步协作开发，一卡一顿的感觉真不好受。所以我怀疑那些当老板的，是不是从来不会进入心流，每天都要开会、处理繁杂的事务。 5 whywhathow 21h 31m ago 1 最大恐惧是,忙里忙外,自己一无所获的无力感/🕳 7 whywhathow 20h 47m ago 1 @lxxzml 我的感受更像是自己的 context 被撑爆, 跟不上 ai 的思路噻. emmm, 要用/grill-me 了. 8 V2Try 20h 31m ago via iPhone 产品经理会进入心流吗？我感觉做家务都能进入心流😂 9 jaoyina 20h 17m ago 不用 AI 心流是什么感觉？ 10 loading 20h 15m ago via Android 正常，你只是正在成为恶龙。心态放松，以前产品经理不会细看你的代码，现在你也可以适当放开一点。 12 iiduce 19h 47m ago 是这样的，这是我开始 vibe coding 后最大的遗憾。我之前写代码比较容易进入心流状态，vibe coding 后一次也没有过。vibe coding 也有爽感，但显然和心流状态不同。心流状态的爽感来自于内啡肽，vibe coding 则来自于多巴胺，和赌博、性交手淫一样，vibe coding 完，经常是一阵空虚。完成了目标，却没有以前手写代码的满足感。 13 levelworm 19h 45m ago via iPhone 那是。心流是需要用功的。所以我现在仅用 AI 做文档、流程图这些没人看的东西，顺便刷榜，写代码还是自己手写—-除了一些脚本扔给 AI 之外。 14 tangzui 19h 37m ago 最崩不住的是你去接口别人 vibe coding 的代码 16 foryou2023 19h 6m ago 一个项目一个项目的搞，一个模块的搞。同时开多个项目，大脑就被撑爆了。 17 jh623 18h 50m ago 我感觉还好啊，ai 在干活，自己规划下一步，或者考虑架构优化。我写下一步规划都写了几千字了，近百个需求，完成一个删一个，还挺爽。 18 nsjs 18h 41m ago via iPhone 换个快点的 ai agent 也能进入心流的，类似 REPL ，发指令看结果的循环 19 lucays 18h 28m ago via Android 心流有啥用，心流完了脑子特别累其他人的代码我接手也直接 ai 一把梭 20 yh7gdiaYW 18h 27m ago 自己全栈开发还好，还需要和前/后端对接的时候真是噩梦，AI 写的有些细节我是真不知道它怎么想的... 22 yoyoyoyolol 10h 43m ago 确实是这样，尤其是 token 用不完的情况下不想浪费，还要同时并行考虑其他产品的需求和产品设计，来回切换很麻烦，消耗大脑 23 wukaige 6h 5m ago 还是能进入心流状态的，把关键功能抽出来，和 ai 讨论功能设计，一步步优化最终定稿后，才让 ai 动手，而不是一上来就让 ai 完成某个功能。这样比较容易进入心流状态 24 noorall 4h 43m ago 毕业前夕几乎每天都是心流，两周写了 3w 行数据库内核代码，怀念那段日子 25 tangler OP 4h 39m ago @V2Try 我观察到的产品大部分时间也都在擦屁股,真正思考产品本身和写 prd 的时间不多 27 xiaoyi123 3h 43m ago 已经没有心流了，就是不停地切换不同的对话.就像给多匹马喂食一样，看到哪匹马吃完了就赶紧投料... 28 youyouzi 3h 19m ago 流水线生产哪有匠心可言？回归基本功，手搓代码，当编程仙人。","fetched_at":"2026-08-26T07:30:20.187Z","ok":true}